{"seq":2,"slug":"balance-shortage-overhang-handling","title":"核销平衡、短少与溢余的处理规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/processing-trade-bonded-manual-bom/manual-writeoff-audit/balance-shortage-overhang-handling","wordCount":2935,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"核销平衡-短少与溢余的处理规则\">核销平衡、短少与溢余的处理规则</h1><p>海关报核那张表上最后一行永远是一个差值：进口了多少保税料件，出口成品按单耗倒算应该耗掉多少，两者相减就是账面上「应该还在仓库里」的数量。企业拿着这个数去点库，点出来的数字与账面数对不上时，多出来的叫<strong>溢余</strong>，少掉的叫<strong>短少</strong>。这一行差值决定了整本手册能不能核销掉，也决定了关务部门这个月是正常结案还是收到一张《稽查通知书》。本文把平衡方程写清楚，再把短少与溢余各自的成因、补税口径、举证责任与系统建模拆开讲，因为绝大多数核销失败不是算错，而是把两类差异混成了一个数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-核销平衡方程与报核对账基准\">核心概念：核销平衡方程与报核对账基准</h2><p>加工贸易手册的核销逻辑建立在一条守恒关系上——<strong>进口的保税料件，最终只能有三种去向</strong>：物化进出口成品、以边角料/残次品等形式留在境内、或者仍在库存中。基于《中华人民共和国海关加工贸易货物监管办法》（海关总署令第113号）与《海关加工贸易单耗管理办法》（海关总署令第155号），这条守恒关系被写成三段式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>进口料件量</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>耗料量</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>剩余料件量</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{进口料件量} = \\text{耗料量} + \\text{剩余料件量}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">进口料件量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">耗料量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">剩余料件量</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中耗料量由出口成品量与备案单耗相乘得到：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>耗料量</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>出口成品量</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>单耗</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{耗料量} = \\sum\\_{i} \\text{出口成品量}\\_i \\times \\text{单耗}\\_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">耗料量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">出口成品量</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单耗</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把两式相减，得到核销时真正用来对账的<strong>应剩量</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>应剩量</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>进口料件量</mtext><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>出口成品量</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>单耗</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{应剩量} = \\text{进口料件量} - \\sum\\_{i} \\text{出口成品量}\\_i \\times \\text{单耗}\\_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应剩量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">进口料件量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">出口成品量</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单耗</span></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>企业把仓库里同一料件的实际结存记为<strong>实存</strong>,则差异为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>实存</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>应剩量</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = \\text{实存} - \\text{应剩量}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实存</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应剩量</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 手册平衡；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 即<strong>短少</strong>，说明保税料件少了；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 即<strong>溢余</strong>，说明账外多了料件。这条式子看着简单，工程上的坑全在右边第一个乘积里——它依赖监控期内每一笔出口成品量与当时的备案单耗一致，而单耗本身会随 BOM 版本变更。任何一个版本没对齐，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 就会凭空偏移。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[进口保税料件量] --&gt; D[应剩量 = 进口 - 出口×单耗]&#10;  B[出口成品量 × 备案单耗] --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[实存盘点]&#10;  E --&gt; F{差值 Δ}&#10;  F --&gt;|Δ = 0| G[核销平衡 → 结案]&#10;  F --&gt;|Δ &lt; 0| H[短少 → 补税/处罚/免责举证]&#10;  F --&gt;|Δ &gt; 0| I[溢余 → 补备案/内销/退运]&#10;  H --&gt; J[差异归集: 单耗错? 损耗错? 库存错?]&#10;  I --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n  A[进口保税料件量] --&gt; D[应剩量 = 进口 - 出口×单耗]\n  B[出口成品量 × 备案单耗] --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[实存盘点]\n  E --&gt; F{差值 Δ}\n  F --&gt;|Δ = 0| G[核销平衡 → 结案]\n  F --&gt;|Δ &lt; 0| H[短少 → 补税/处罚/免责举证]\n  F --&gt;|Δ &gt; 0| I[溢余 → 补备案/内销/退运]\n  H --&gt; J[差异归集: 单耗错? 损耗错? 库存错?]\n  I --&gt; J</pre><p>这张图的工程含义是：<strong>短少与溢余先要定位到「哪一类原因」，才能决定处置路径</strong>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 直接当作一个数字去补税，会在后续稽查中暴露归因失败——海关罚的是「无法说明去向」的部分，而不是全部差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"短少-定义-成因分类与法律后果\">短少：定义、成因分类与法律后果</h2><p><strong>短少</strong>指手册项下保税料件的实际结存少于按单耗倒算的应剩量。它的法律性质是一道分界线：海关首先推定短少部分的保税料件<strong>已脱离监管</strong>（可能被内销、串换或挪用），举证责任落在企业一方。企业若不能说明合法去向，短少部分需<strong>按料件（或成品）补缴进口关税与进口环节增值税</strong>，并可能依据《海关行政处罚实施条例》（国务院令第420号）按「擅自内销」或「申报不实」处以漏缴税款一定倍数的罚款。</p>\n<p>短少的成因必须先分类，因为不同类别的处置完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成因类别</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>是否免责</th>\n<th>处置路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>单耗申报偏高</strong></td>\n<td>净耗填大、损耗率填高，理论耗料虚高</td>\n<td>否（申报差错）</td>\n<td>重新核定单耗，差额回归库存，属<strong>账差</strong>非实短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>工艺损耗超标</strong></td>\n<td>实际损耗超备案标耗，料件真的没了</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>超部分需补税，须有工艺证明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>库存管理差错</strong></td>\n<td>盘点错误、串料、批次混料</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>调整账目，补足或说明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>擅自内销/挪用</strong></td>\n<td>保税料件违规用于内销或生产非保税品</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>补税 + 罚款，严重者刑事</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>不可抗力灭失</strong></td>\n<td>火灾、水灾、被盗等非工艺原因损毁</td>\n<td><strong>可</strong></td>\n<td>据实核销并提供证明材料，免补税</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键分界是<strong>账差与实短</strong>。前两类中的「单耗申报偏高」本质是核销公式的参数错了，料件其实还在库里，属于<strong>账面短少</strong>，纠正单耗即可消除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，不构成违规。很多企业一看到短少就急着补税，反而把一个可以调整的参数错误变成了实质性的税款流失。系统上必须把这两种短少分开记账：账面短少走「单耗复算」流程，实物流失走「差异核销」流程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[核销短少 Δ &lt; 0] --&gt; A{短少料的物理去向}&#10;  A --&gt;|仍在库, 是账面错| B[账面短少]&#10;  A --&gt;|已流出库| C[实物短少]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[复核单耗/损耗率&lt;br/&gt;调整后 Δ 归零]&#10;  B1 --&gt; B2[无需补税]&#10;  C --&gt; C1{是否不可抗力}&#10;  C1 --&gt;|是| C2[据实核销 + 证明材料]&#10;  C1 --&gt;|否| C3[补税 + 可能罚款]\">graph TD\n  S[核销短少 Δ &lt; 0] --&gt; A{短少料的物理去向}\n  A --&gt;|仍在库, 是账面错| B[账面短少]\n  A --&gt;|已流出库| C[实物短少]\n  B --&gt; B1[复核单耗/损耗率&lt;br/&gt;调整后 Δ 归零]\n  B1 --&gt; B2[无需补税]\n  C --&gt; C1{是否不可抗力}\n  C1 --&gt;|是| C2[据实核销 + 证明材料]\n  C1 --&gt;|否| C3[补税 + 可能罚款]</pre><p>短少还有一个常被忽略的<strong>时点问题</strong>。手册核销的截点是主管海关规定的报核期限，超期未报核的，海关会先按「超期未核销」处理，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 的归因窗口已经关闭，企业举证难度陡增。因此核销数据必须<strong>按监控期内逐笔出口量实时滚动</strong>，而不是等到期才一次性倒算——滚动记账让差异在发生当期就能被发现并归因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"溢余-来源-核销处置与内销\">溢余：来源、核销处置与内销</h2><p><strong>溢余</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>）指实存多于应剩量，账面之外多出了保税料件。它比短少少见但不罕见，同样需要说明来源。溢余的成因与处置如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>溢余来源</th>\n<th>机理</th>\n<th>处置方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>单耗申报偏低</strong></td>\n<td>净耗/损耗率填小，理论耗料虚低</td>\n<td>修正单耗，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 归零，属账差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>供应商多发货</strong></td>\n<td>境外供货实际到货多于申报数量</td>\n<td>补报关/补备案，逾期的按违规处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>料件替代节约</strong></td>\n<td>工艺改进使实际耗料低于备案值</td>\n<td>修正单耗或按剩余料件处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>串换回收料</strong></td>\n<td>用非保税料顶替后回收出保税料</td>\n<td>需说明并调整账目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>溢余料件的处置路径有三条：<strong>退运出境</strong>、<strong>内销补税</strong>、或<strong>结转</strong>到下本手册继续使用。依据海关对加工贸易剩余料件、边角料、残次品、副产品的内销规定，保税料件内销须经海关批准并按其<strong>对应的进口料件</strong>补税，不能以成品状态计征。这里最容易出错的是<strong>归类与价格的确定时点</strong>——补税用的是内销时的适用税率和料件申报价格，而非进口当时的旧价格，税率变动会直接改变补税金额。</p>\n<p>溢余若长期不处理，会累积成一本「负数手册」的镜像：进口量远小于理论耗料量，下一轮核销必然报平不了。系统对溢余应设置<strong>阈值告警</strong>：当某料件的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> / 应剩量超过约定比例（例如 3%）时，强制触发人工归因流程，而不是让它随着手册结转一次次滚下去。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核销平衡表的系统建模\">核销平衡表的系统建模</h2><p>把上面两类差异落进系统，核心是把「账」和「物」分成两条独立的流水，再在核销时对撞出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表</th>\n<th>承载内容</th>\n<th>关键字段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>进口流水账</strong></td>\n<td>每批保税料件进口数量</td>\n<td>料件号、数量、单位、报关单号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>出口成品账</strong></td>\n<td>每批出口成品量与当时生效单耗</td>\n<td>成品号、数量、单耗版本、监控期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>库存实物账</strong></td>\n<td>盘点/出入库实际结存</td>\n<td>料件号、实存数量、盘点时点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>核销差异账</strong></td>\n<td>每次报核的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 及其归因结论</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>、归因类别、处置动作、凭证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>出口成品账必须<strong>带单耗版本快照</strong>。因为单耗可以随 BOM 变更而调整，若出口流水的每一笔都去查「当前单耗」，历史出口量就会被事后篡改，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 失去可复算性。正确做法是在出口报文生成时把当时生效的单耗值写死进快照，核销时用快照值倒算——这与 <a href=\"../manual-item-bom-record/bom-version-filing-change-control\">BOM 版本与备案变更控制</a> 中讲的版本快照是同一套机制，也是 <a href=\"../unit-consumption-loss/unit-consumption-definition-calculation\">单耗定义、净耗与工艺损耗的计算模型</a> 里「净耗与单耗必须可加」在核销侧的落地。</p>\n<p>差异账的归因结论必须<strong>带凭证号</strong>并可追溯：账面短少的凭证是复核后的单耗备案回执，实物短少的凭证是不可抗力证明或补税单，溢余的凭证是内销批准文件或退运报关单。没有凭证的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 在稽查时等同于「无法说明去向」，这正是罚款的落点。系统层面应把「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 归因完成率」作为一个内部质量指标，任何未归因的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 在报核前必须清零。</p>\n<h2 id=\"违规短少与合理差异的分界与举证\">违规短少与合理差异的分界与举证</h2><p>企业最关心的问题是一个数字：<strong>短少多少会被认定为违规</strong>。答案不取决于绝对量，而取决于<strong>能否归因</strong>。海关的执法逻辑是「差额 + 无法解释」= 违规；「差额 + 合理解释 + 凭证」= 合理差异，按实调整。</p>\n<p>举证的三类材料决定成败：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>书面说明</strong>：逐笔说明短少的物理去向，与台账流水一一对应，不能是笼统的「管理损耗」。</li>\n<li><strong>外部凭证</strong>：报关单、补税单、内销批准文件、检验检疫证明、保险理赔单、公安报案回执等具有第三方证明力的文件。</li>\n<li><strong>技术证明</strong>：工艺部门的损耗实测报告、第三方检测报告，用于支撑「实际损耗超备案标耗」的主张。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者的组合强度决定了补税与罚款的边界。仅有书面说明而无外部凭证的短少，通常被要求补税；有完整凭证链的不可抗力短少则可免补税。<strong>串案风险</strong>在于：同一料件在多本手册上反复出现同向短少，会被稽查系统识别为模式性违规，从而把单本手册的「合理差异」升级为「系统性擅自内销」。因此跨手册的短少应做<strong>同向性监控</strong>，避免多本手册的同类差异彼此印证出违规模式。</p>\n<p>从工程视角看，<a href=\"../unit-consumption-loss/loss-ratio-abnormal-tolerance-audit\">损耗率异常与容差稽查</a> 里讲的容差带，正是核销差异的<strong>前置预警</strong>：损耗率本身超容差时，核销必然出现短少，与其到期后补税，不如在损耗率阶段就拦截。核销平衡处理是这套监管数据的最后一道对账，它的价值不在于算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，而在于把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 逼回到单耗、损耗、库存三个可修正的上游参数上去。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>平衡方程是三段式</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>进口</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>耗料</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>剩余</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{进口} = \\text{耗料} + \\text{剩余}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">进口</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">耗料</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">剩余</span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>耗料</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mtext>出口成品量</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>单耗</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{耗料} = \\sum \\text{出口成品量} \\times \\text{单耗}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">耗料</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">出口成品量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单耗</span></span></span></span></span></span>，差异 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>实存</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>应剩量</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = \\text{实存} - \\text{应剩量}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实存</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应剩量</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>短少先分类再处置</strong>：账面短少（单耗申报偏高）修正参数即可，实物短少才涉及补税与举证，不可抗力可免补税。</li>\n<li><strong>溢余三条出路</strong>：退运、内销补税（按对应进口料件、用内销时税率与价格）、结转下本手册。</li>\n<li><strong>归因决定性质</strong>：海关罚的是「差额 + 无法说明去向」，凭证链（报关单、补税单、不可抗力证明）是分界。</li>\n<li><strong>系统建模要点</strong>：出口成品账必须带单耗版本快照，差异账必须带凭证号，「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 归因完成率」应作为报核前的强制清零指标。</li>\n<li><strong>滚动优于期终</strong>：按监控期逐笔滚动对账，才能在归因窗口关闭前发现问题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"核销平衡、短少与溢余的处理规则","id":"核销平衡-短少与溢余的处理规则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：核销平衡方程与报核对账基准","id":"核心概念-核销平衡方程与报核对账基准"},{"level":2,"text":"短少：定义、成因分类与法律后果","id":"短少-定义-成因分类与法律后果"},{"level":2,"text":"溢余：来源、核销处置与内销","id":"溢余-来源-核销处置与内销"},{"level":2,"text":"核销平衡表的系统建模","id":"核销平衡表的系统建模"},{"level":2,"text":"违规短少与合理差异的分界与举证","id":"违规短少与合理差异的分界与举证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"报核周期与核销数据准备（报关单归集与配平）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/processing-trade-bonded-manual-bom/manual-writeoff-audit/writeoff-cycle-data-preparation"},"next":{"title":"海关稽查、单证不符与整改闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/processing-trade-bonded-manual-bom/manual-writeoff-audit/customs-audit-discrepancy-remediation"}}